{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"dwarf_city_gate","model_identifier":"dwarf_city_gate","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# dwarf_city_gate\n\nDwarf city gate: a huge carved stone gate set into a cliff face, iron-bound bronze doors under a stepped lintel with a carved face, and two stone guardian statues with axes. Neutral.\n\n- Footprint: 20 x 8 columns (320 x 128 units, 9.00 x 3.60 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -176..178, y 0..330, z -120..64 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 1024, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 47, construction_0 40, construction_33 78, construction_66 97, ruined 91 (0 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- cliff and gate: 354 x 330 x 70 centred at x 0, z 30 (the 88 x 196 doorway at x 0 is the way in)\n- statues: two 66 x 190 x 66 boxes at x -110 / +110, z -30\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `dwarf_city_gate_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `dwarf_city_gate_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_dwarf_city_gate` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `open` | 4.0 | once | the great doors swing inward slowly and hold. |\n| `close` | 4.0 | once | the doors swing shut. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -24)\n"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":1024},"elements":[{"name":"cliff","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-160.0,0.0,0.0],"to":[160.0,300.0,64.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[34.0,0.0,354.0,300.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[354.0,0.0,418.0,300.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[34.0,0.0,354.0,300.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[354.0,0.0,418.0,300.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[172.0,580.0,492.0,644.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[172.0,580.0,492.0,644.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"c52da908-1717-596f-9baf-3fabd7c3f6a0"},{"name":"cliff_top","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-150.0,300.0,10.0],"to":[150.0,330.0,60.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,798.0,300.0,828.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[300.0,798.0,350.0,828.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,798.0,300.0,828.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[300.0,798.0,350.0,828.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,708.0,300.0,758.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,708.0,300.0,758.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"492aeadf-0a1a-5823-a4a1-371b3f35c1ed"},{"name":"cliff_l","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-176.0,0.0,10.0],"to":[-160.0,240.0,60.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[50.0,340.0,66.0,580.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,340.0,50.0,580.0],"texture":0},